    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana bakwa Aroni bali ni Nadabu, Abihu, Eleasa na Itama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.1+LEV.10.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Levi 10:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo Nadabu na Abihu bafwile lintu shibo talafwa, elyo tabakwete abana abaume. Kanshi Eleasa na Itama ebalebomba imilimo ya bushimapepo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Sadoki uwa mu lupwa lwakwa Eleasa na Ahimeleki uwa mu lupwa lwakwa Itama ebayafwilishe Davidi ukubabika mu mpuka mu mpuka mukubomba imilimo bapeelwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Impendwa iyikalamba iya ntungulushi yasangilwe mu ba mu lupwa lwakwa Eleasa ukucila mu ba mu lupwa lwakwa Itama. Eico bafumya intungulushi ikumi limo na mutanda (16) isha mayanda ya bashibo mu lupwa lwakwa Eleasari, elyo impendwa cine konse konse intungulushi sha mu mayanda ya bashibo mu lupwa lwakwa Itama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babakenye mukubapendula pantu palipo bacilolo ba mu cifulo camushilo na bacilolo bakwa Lesa pakati ka ba mu lupwa lwakwa Eleasa na ba mu lupwa lwakwa Itama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalemba uwe shina lya Shemaiya mwana Netaneli umwina Levi, ewalembele amashina yabo pa menso ya mfumu elyo na bacilolo abali ni Sadoki shimapepo, Ahimeleki mwana Abiyata elyo ne ntungulushi sha mu mayanda ya bashimapepo na ya bena Levi. Babalemba mukutantika aba mu ŋanda imo ukufuma muli Eleasa elyo na ba mu ŋanda imo ukufuma muli Itama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyatantikwe ukukonkana kwabo mukubomba ilyo baleingila mu ŋanda yakwa Yawe, umwabelele ifipope ifya bashilile shibo Aroni, ngefyo Lesa wa bena Israeli amukonkomeshe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bashele aba mu lupwa lwakwa Levi bafumine mu bana bakwa Amuramu, Shubaeli, na ba muli Shubaeli ni Yedeiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 24:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ebali abana bakwa Levi umwabelele amayanda ya bashibo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.24.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.24.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
